          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai kicik Yosua, kisimukek iŋes ka kitogogoŋ etau keŋ, anerae iŋes etubor ekekwaye iŋarenikinit ŋituŋa lu, iŋes eryamikini ikes akwap ŋina ibuni iyoŋ akiŋolikin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
